From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nomorecoolnicknames <nomorecoolnicknames@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 05:55:39 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] linkerconfig: sphal: also link libnetutils.so for legacy MTK
 Mali drivers

libbwc of the MT6735/MT6753/MT6755 Mali-T720/T860 stacks needs
libnetutils.so, which is VNDK-core and not visible in sphal.
libutilscallstack.so is not added: it is VNDK-SP and already reachable.
libui.so is deliberately not added: the Nougat Mali driver reads Region
fields in the Nougat layout, and the platform Region (FatVector) crashed
HWUI, so Region has to come from a vendor shim with that layout.
A no-op on the MX6, whose own copy sits in the sphal search paths ahead
of the link.

Change-Id: Ib65c10631fb33d397b42c060ff77185126a4a09f

diff --git a/contents/namespace/sphal.cc b/contents/namespace/sphal.cc
index efbf4a0..9f4a2fe 100644
--- a/contents/namespace/sphal.cc
+++ b/contents/namespace/sphal.cc
@@ -89,6 +89,20 @@ Namespace BuildSphalNamespace([[maybe_unused]] const Context& ctx) {
     // Without it SurfaceFlinger and zygote cannot load EGL. Expose exactly
     // libbinder.so; the rest of VNDK-core stays out of sphal.
     ns.GetLink("vndk").AddSharedLib("libbinder.so");
+    // Same closure on the MT6735/MT6753/MT6755 fleet (Mali-T720/T860): libbwc
+    // NEEDs libnetutils.so (VNDK-core, plain C API). A vendor copy in sphal's
+    // own search paths still wins over the link, so devices that ship one
+    // (m95) are unaffected.
+    // Not needed here: libutilscallstack.so (android::CallStack) is VNDK-SP
+    // and already reachable through VNDK_SAMEPROCESS_LIBRARIES_VENDOR above; a
+    // blob that imports CallStack without NEEDing it needs a DT_NEEDED patch,
+    // not a link.
+    // Deliberately NOT libui.so: N-era Mali reads android::Region fields with
+    // the Nougat layout (Vector<Rect>, 32 bytes) while A10+ Region is a
+    // FatVector (~90 bytes) -- linking the platform libui crashed every HWUI
+    // process on m95 (device/meizu/m95/shims/region.cpp). Region has to come
+    // from a vendor shim with the N layout instead.
+    ns.GetLink("vndk").AddSharedLib("libnetutils.so");
     ns.AddRequires(std::vector{"libneuralnetworks.so"});
   }
 
